---
// One turn of the engine. Inline SVG, theme variables, no external assets.
---
<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 210" role="img" aria-label="The engine loop: question, model, identity and policy, tool, result back to the model">
    <defs>
      <marker id="ah" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L8 4L0 8z" fill="#697080"/></marker>
    </defs>
    <g stroke="#14171f" stroke-width="1.2" fill="#fff">
      <rect x="10" y="70" width="110" height="56" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="170" y="70" width="110" height="56" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="330" y="70" width="150" height="56" rx="8" fill="#e8f3f0" stroke="#0e6b5c"/>
      <rect x="530" y="70" width="100" height="56" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="670" y="70" width="80" height="56" rx="8"/>
    </g>
    <g font-size="14" fill="#14171f" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">
      <text x="65" y="103">Question</text>
      <text x="225" y="103">Model</text>
      <text x="405" y="95">Identity + policy</text>
      <text x="580" y="103">Tool</text>
      <text x="710" y="103">Result</text>
    </g>
    <g font-size="12" fill="#697080" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="405" y="113">who · allow · ask · deny</text>
      <text x="225" y="143">asks for a tool</text>
      <text x="580" y="143">runs once</text>
    </g>
    <g stroke="#697080" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" marker-end="url(#ah)">
      <path d="M120 98H168"/><path d="M280 98H328"/><path d="M480 98H528"/><path d="M630 98H668"/>
      <path d="M710 70V30H225V68" />
    </g>
    <text x="470" y="22" font-size="12" fill="#697080" text-anchor="middle">the result goes back to the model, until it answers without a tool</text>
    <g stroke="#b42318" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" marker-end="url(#ah)"><path d="M405 126V176"/></g>
    <text x="405" y="196" font-size="12" fill="#b42318" text-anchor="middle">denied: the model is told why, the tool never ran</text>
  </svg>
</figure>
